{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S05把暴露心意后的痛苦具体化为怕对方嫌自己太黏、原有相处变得隔阂，偏向害怕自己的需求过重、遭到嫌弃。\",\n    \"S07-S09把亲密幸福与痛苦较多地系于对方是否需要他的陪伴、是否会想到他，主线容易偏向能否被需要、能否成为对方重要的陪伴者，而不是亲密本身无法留住。\",\n    \"S11继续以对方以后是否需要他陪伴作为主要假设，延续了被需要与否这一侧的顾虑。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S11仍借由对方以后是否需要他的陪伴来表达对亲密无法延续的担忧，略带被需要与否的具体顾虑，但没有取代整体主线。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y更直接地把亲密本身的幸福与它可能消失的痛楚缠在一起：越享受当下，越舍不得结束；越愿意毫无保留地喜欢，越清楚自己无法保证这份亲密永远持续。X也包含这两面，但多次把失去亲密的恐惧具体转向对方是否需要自己、是否会嫌自己太黏，使主线部分偏向被需要与被接纳的焦虑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3ea4834d-c5ad-43dd-bfbf-cb3affde225d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T084819380142Z", "elapsed_seconds": 30.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:48:49.489764+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7863d1ed0e08ba649962e0e1db6744f381275d4ae1c855ee68d6fa668b3c4a7f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f99